                                                "example_id": "09466ca4-411a-4de6-995a-724b3c70051a",
                                                "sense_id": "39d26375-61b2-32bb-9f75-21811ce1a0c1",
                                                "text": "They, therefore, began to work more harmoniously, and finally were amalgamated on August 13, 1859, […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c95ef31-7c69-40df-bf7b-173f387b8652",
                                                "sense_id": "39d26375-61b2-32bb-9f75-21811ce1a0c1",
                                                "text": "Danziger’s new Green Dragon, a delicate and airy Lepidium, is a unique green filler for flower arrangements that blends harmoniously in any centerpiece or bouquet."
